@startuml
title SC-ORD-018 — Paid, and the stock is confirmed late but in time
actor Customer as C
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Notification" as N

P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O : CONFIRMING_STOCK
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
note over I #ECEFF1 : restarting: the message waits,\nPub/Sub delivers it again
C -> O : order status?
O --> C : PENDING
... less than the review delay ...
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmed
note over O #C8E6C9 : COMPLETED\norder CONFIRMED
O ->> N : OrderConfirmed
C -> O : order status?
O --> C : CONFIRMED
@enduml
